{"id":"1a33b61258cd56ac","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-deduction-theorem.md","title":"Deduction Theorem","display":"Deduction Theorem","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-deduction-theorem","aliases":["93-lem-deduction-theorem"],"display":"Deduction Theorem","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-deduction-detachment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-deduction-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-deduction-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Deduction Theorem"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"401bbe09a57b89ee\" href=\"?note=401bbe09a57b89ee\" title=\"93-df-deduction-detachment\">93-df-deduction-detachment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-deduction-theorem---Deduction-Theorem\">lem-deduction-theorem - Deduction Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span> is a consequence relation, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to:F^2\\to F\">\\(\\to:F^2\\to F\\)</span> is a binary connective.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\">\\(\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\)</span> is the deduction-detachment property of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"401bbe09a57b89ee\" href=\"?note=401bbe09a57b89ee\" title=\"93-df-deduction-detachment\">93-df-deduction-detachment</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This equivalence is not valid for an arbitrary consequence relation merely\nbecause its language contains implication; it is the deduction-detachment\nproperty that must be established for the chosen calculus.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-deduction-theorem---Deduction-Theorem","text":"lem-deduction-theorem - Deduction Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-deduction-detachment","status":"resolved","id":"401bbe09a57b89ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deduction-detachment]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deduction-detachment","status":"resolved","id":"401bbe09a57b89ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)$ is the deduction-detachment property of [[93-df-deduction-detachment]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\to:F^2\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1092,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["401bbe09a57b89ee"]}